---

This repository is an installer/launcher harness only. It downloads and runs
third-party software at setup time; nothing third-party is committed here:

- audio.cpp by 0xShug0 - Apache License 2.0 (https://github.com/0xShug0/audio.cpp)
- OmniVoice by k2-fsa - Apache License 2.0 (https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice)
- OmniVoice GGUF conversions by audio-cpp (https://huggingface.co/audio-cpp/audio.cpp-gguf)
  - model weights keep the upstream Apache-2.0 license

See docs/model_licenses.md inside the audio.cpp release for all bundled
component licenses.
